# Placeholders only. Never commit real secrets.
#
# Optional. Leave unset in local development: the frontend calls same-origin /api and the Vite dev
# server proxies it to the local Worker (http://localhost:8787). Set it only if the API is served
# from a different origin (that origin would then need to allow CORS, which this Worker does not add).
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8787
#
# The Worker needs no environment variables or secrets in Phase 4 (only the local D1 binding "DB").
# Later phases (server-side only, set via Wrangler secrets, never VITE_ prefixed):
# ADMIN_TOKEN=change-me
